dWcgNjk4OTg2OiBSZW1lbWJlciB0byBmel92YXIoKSB2YXJpYWJsZSBkcm9wcGVkIGluCiBmel9j
YXRjaCgpLgoKLS0tCiBzb3VyY2UvcGRmL3BkZi1zdHJlYW0uYyB8IDIgKysKIDEgZmlsZSBjaGFu
Z2VkLCAyIGluc2VydGlvbnMoKykKCmRpZmYgLS1naXQgYS9zb3VyY2UvcGRmL3BkZi1zdHJlYW0u
YyBiL3NvdXJjZS9wZGYvcGRmLXN0cmVhbS5jCmluZGV4IGM2YmE3YWQuLmZiNTE3ODcgMTAwNjQ0
Ci0tLSBhL3NvdXJjZS9wZGYvcGRmLXN0cmVhbS5jCisrKyBiL3NvdXJjZS9wZGYvcGRmLXN0cmVh
bS5jCkBAIC0zMDUsNiArMzA1LDggQEAgcGRmX29wZW5fcmF3X2ZpbHRlcihmel9jb250ZXh0ICpj
dHgsIGZ6X3N0cmVhbSAqY2hhaW4sIHBkZl9kb2N1bWVudCAqZG9jLCBwZGZfb2IKIAogCWNoYWlu
ID0gZnpfa2VlcF9zdHJlYW0oY3R4LCBjaGFpbik7CiAKKwlmel92YXIoY2hhaW4pOworCiAJZnpf
dHJ5KGN0eCkKIAl7CiAJCWxlbiA9IHBkZl90b19pbnQoY3R4LCBwZGZfZGljdF9nZXQoY3R4LCBz
